it can still reason through it and make its best effort to reason through the data, the information to try to understand how to solve the problem.
它仍然能够进行推理，并尽最大努力分析数据和信息，尝试理解如何解决问题。

249
00:25:18,360 --> 00:25:19,592
Artificial intelligence.
人工智能。

250
00:25:19,642 --> 00:25:23,815
Okay, so this basic framework is now being integrated and and everything that I just described,
好，这种基本框架现在正被整合，我刚才描述的一切都已融入其中，

